    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Kora mutabane wa Izahara era nga mwidhukulu wa Kohathi ow'ekika kya Levi, ghalala ni Dathani ni Abiramu batabane ba Eliabu, era ni Oni mutabane wa Pelethi, ow'ekika kya Reubeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JUD.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yud 11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "beesitula nga bali n'abantu ebikumi bibiri n'ataanu, nga bakulembeze mu Isiraeli era nga bamanhiibwa bukalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beesoloza, baaja baadheemera Musa ni Aaroni, baabakoba bati: “Mubitiriiza okwekuluntaza! Abantu boonaboona ab'eighanga lino ba Musengwa Katonda era Musengwa Katonda aba mu ife. Kale lwaki mwetwala nga muli ba ghaigulu inho okusinga abantu ba Musengwa Katonda abo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa bweyawulira ebyo yaakutama n'ekyeni kyatuuka ku itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala, yaakoba Kora ni baine boonaboona ati: “Enkyo Musengwa Katonda aidha kutwoleka oyo owuwe atuukiriire, era oyo aidha kumuseesa kumpi ni mwene. Oyo y'anaalonda aidha kumuseesa kumpi ni mwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpegaano mwidha kukola muti: iwe Kora ni baino boonaboona mwidha kugema ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mubiteemu omuliro enkyo era mute obubbaani ku muliro okwo mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. Omuntu Musengwa Katonda y'anaalonda n'aidha okuba atuukiriire. Imwe baidhukulu ba Levi mubitiriiza okwekuluntaza!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa era yaakoba Kora ati: “Muwulire, imwe baidhukulu ba Levi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukibona nga kintu kitono, Katonda wa Isiraeli okulonda imwe mu bantu be Abaisiraeli boonaboona n'abaseesa okumpi ni mwene, mugheerezenga mu Weema ye era mwemererenga mu maiso g'abantu be abo okubagheereza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yabaseesa kumpi ni mwene, iwe ni baganda bo baidhukulu ba Levi. Buti muli kwenda mufune n'obwakabona bwona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mukimanhe muti, iwe ni baino boonaboona muli kudheemera Musengwa Katonda mwene kuba, katyo Aaroni naani memale mumwemuluguunhize?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaayetesa Dathani ni Abiramu batabane ba Eliabu, aye baakoba bati: “Titwidha kwidha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okututoola mu nsi engimu era erimu ebirungi kamaala n'otuleeta okutwitira ghano mu irungu, ti kikumala? Mpegaano oli na kwenda kwefuula mufuzi waife? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu butuufu bwene tiwatuleeta mu nsi ngimu erimu birungi kamaala, era tiwatugha bibandha na masamba ga mizabbibu ni biba byaife ku bwaife. Aye oli kwenda kuziba bwa bantu bano maiso? Kale titwidha kwidha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaasungughala inho era yaakoba Musengwa Katonda ati: “Otasiima kigheebwayo kyaibwe kyonakyona kye banaakuleetera. Nze nzira kintu kye natoola ku bantu abo, waire endogoyi endala eti. Era ghazira waire omulala ku abo ye nakolaku akabi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaakoba Kora ati: “Enkyo, iwe ni baino boonaboona ni Aaroni, mwidhe mubeegho mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muntu ku imwe atoole ekiniokezebwamu obubbaani ekikye, akiteemu obubbaani era akireete mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, ebyo nga n'ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani ebikumi ebibiri n'ataanu, era n'iwe ni Aaroni, buli muntu n'ekiniokezebwamu obubbaani ekikye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale buli muntu yaatoola ekiniokezebwamu obubbaani ekikye, yaakitaamu omuliro n'obubbaani, era boonaboona baayemerera ku mulyango ogw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, nga bali ni Musa ni Aaroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kora yaasoloza abantu boonaboona, baayemerera ku mulyango ogw'Eweema eyo nga balingiriire Musa ni Aaroni. Agho ekitiisa kya Musengwa Katonda kyabonekera abantu boonaboona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ni Aaroni ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwesende muve mu bantu bano, mbazikirize amangu gano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Musa ni Aaroni baakutama n'ebyeni byatuuka ku itaka, baakoba bati: “Wo Katonda waife, niiwe ensimuko ey'obulamu obwa buli kintu. Omuntu omulala bw'akola ekibi osungughalira abantu boonaboona?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koba abantu boonaboona bave okumpi ni weema dha Kora, Dathani, ni Abiramu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa yaasituka, yaaja ye Dathani, ni Abiramu. Abakulembeze mu Isiraeli baamunonereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba abantu boonaboona ati: “Mbeeghemba muve okumpi ni weema edh'abantu bano ababi era mutagema ku kintu kyaibwe kyonakyona. Bwe mutaakole mutyo, musobola okuzikirizibwa ghalala nabo olw'ebibi byaibwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale abantu beesenda, baaba ghala ni weema dha Kora, ni Dathani, ni Abiramu. Dathani ni Abiramu baafuluma baayemerera gha miryango egy'eweema dhaibwe, ghalala ni bakazi baibwe era n'abaana baibwe abato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba abantu ati: “Ku kino kwe munaamanhira nga Musengwa Katonda n'eyantuma okukola ebintu ebyo byonabyona, era nga tibikola ku bwange zenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bano bwe bafanga olumbe olwabuliidho, oba enkomerero yaibwe n'eba ng'ey'abantu ababuliidho, agho Musengwa Katonda anaabanga nga ti n'eyantuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Musengwa Katonda bw'anaakolagho ekintu ekitabangaghooku, eitaka ni lyasama ni libamira beene n'ebyaibwe byonabyona, ni bawolomera mu magombe nga balamu, mwidha kumanha ng'abantu abo baanhooma Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yali amaliriza okwogera ebyo byonabyona, eitaka Dathani ni Abiramu kwe baali beemereire lyetema olutanda olunene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lyabamira aghalala n'eby'omu maka gaibwe, era n'abantu boonaboona abaanonereza Kora ghalala n'ebintu byaibwe byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale batyo baika e magombe nga balamu, n'ebyaibwe byonabyona. Eitaka lyabaziika baasaanagho, abantu nga babona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaali okumpi agho, baalumukagho bwe baawulira okulira kwaibwe. Baakoba bati: “Tulumuke. Eitaka twena litatumira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaasindika omuliro gwayokya abantu ebikumi ebibiri n'ataanu abaali nga bali kuniosa obubbaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koba Eleazari mutabane wa Aaroni kabona atoolegho ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani okuva mu kyokero aghayiiriire abantu abo. Amanda agasansaanize eyo eghala, kuba ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani ebyo bitukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani ebyo eby'abantu abo abaayonoona ni baitibwa, bitukuvu, kuba baabighaayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda. Kale ni ka babigheeseemu amabaati ag'okughembanga ku alutaari, kabenga akamanhiso ak'okulabulanga Abaisiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Eleazari kabona yaatoola ebiniokezebwamu obubbaani ebyo ebyakolebwa mu kyuma ky'ekikomo, abantu abo abaayokebwa bye baaghaayo, yaabighaayo baabigheesaamu eky'okughembanga ku alutaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo kiidha kwidhukizanga Abaisiraeli, ghalobe kubangagho muntu yeenayeena atali kabona wa ku lulyo lw'Aaroni, aseeta mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda okuniokeza obubbaani; kuba asobola okuzikirizibwa nga Kora ni baine bwe baazikirizibwa. Ebyo byakolebwa nga Musengwa Katonda bweyalagira Eleazari ng'abita mu Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwairirira, abantu boonaboona beemuluguunhiza Musa ni Aaroni, nga bakoba bati: “Mwaise abantu ba Musengwa Katonda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe beesoloza boonaboona okwemuluguunhiza Musa ni Aaroni batyo, baaja okulinga y'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, nga babona ekire kigighembyeku, era ekitiisa kya Musengwa Katonda kyaboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Aaroni baidha emberi ow'Eweema eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwesende muve mu bantu bano, mbazikirize buti buti!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Aaroni baakutama n'ebyeni byatuuka ku itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Aaroni ati: “Toola ekiniokezebwamu obubbaani ekikyo, okiteemu omuliro okuva ku alutaari era ote obubbaani ku muliro ogwo. Bw'omala okitwale mangu eri abantu okole omukolo ogw'okubatoolaku ebibi; kuba obusungu bwa Musengwa Katonda bumaze okubatuukaku era endwaire embi etooleire okubaita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Aaroni yaatoola ekiniokezebwamu obubbaani ekikye, yaalumuka yaaja mu bantu, yayagaana nga bwenebwene endwaire embi eri kwita abantu. Agho yaata obubbaani mu kiniokezebwamu ekyo, era yaakola omukolo ogw'okutoola ku bantu ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayemerera ghagati gh'abafu n'abakaali abalamu, endwaire embi eyo yaakoma agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaafa obulwaire obubi obwo baali omutwalo mulala n'enkumi ina na lusanvu (14,700), nga tobaliireeku abo abaafiira mu keediimo ka Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endwaire embi bweyalekera agho okwita abantu, Aaroni yaira ye Musa gha mulyango ogw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
